Subject: Re: Question about Kronecker product models
Message-ID: <U0e5m0OGPTM.I6kda5i7_I0J@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <U0e5m0OGPTM.IIVKiqilrPsJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
